From b7206a7c1ceee05f0afff67ad93775643ee37dfe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eviden0 <Eviden0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 17:54:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] feat(ssa): add ssa_only slim engine profile

- add cmd/yak-ssa and a non-AI slim command list under the ssa_only tag
- move ypb/yakit conversions behind !ssa_only so the slim engine links no gRPC server or yakit facade
- make SCA dependency extraction (Java/PHP/TS) and official C header installation optional
- add slim KV/filter/DB helpers for syntaxflow_scan, sfreport, sfbuildin and resources_monitor
- exclude AI completion commands and the generated gRPC service stubs from the slim build

Slim build: go build -tags ssa_only -trimpath -ldflags="-s -w" ./cmd/yak-ssa
Measured: 824 deps and ~115MB stripped, vs 1461 deps / ~197MB for the default ssa-scan build.
